      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "One of the dieting conundrums in the age of the obesity epidemic is the cycle of weight loss and regain known as the \"yo-yo effect.\" Thaiss et al. (2016) demonstrate that the microbiome plays a key role in this phenomenon and that simple dietary supplementations can reset the weight-rebound clock."
